@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+/*
+ * FastRPC sns_registry interface (Android system properties for the SSC)
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) 2026 The duo2-os Contributors
+ *
+ * This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
